      <p style="color:#ccc;max-width:520px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.92rem;">What we track and report. Complete transparency in our operations.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:#1a1a1a;">
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
